I tried it locally and the bundle size difference for `instantsearch.js/dist/instantsearch.production.min.js` is 0.01KB.

```suggestion
        if (!window[pointer]) {
          window[pointer] = (...args: any[]) => {
            if (!window[pointer].queue) {
              window[pointer].queue = [];
            }

            window[pointer].queue.push(args);
          };
        }
